# rename.1 handoff run — notes

Run: 20261117T084553Z-handoff-muse-code-muse-wonder-1.0-c1 (claimed via one-time link; run_id matched the brief).

## What landed

Full bp3g rename in one change: `bp3 g` is the graph door (create/read/delete, rollup, diagram, icebox), `bp3 n` is the claimed node door, `bp3 e` stays the claimed edge door, and the canonical nested address `bp3 g <graph> n <node> e <edge>` works beside the positional `bp3 g <graph> u <node> <edge>` form. `bp3 q` / `bp3 quest` refuse at the wrapper (usage, exit 2). Verdicts speak graph/node/graphs/nodes, `graph_type`/`node_type`, `node_fin`/`graph_fin`; no dual keys. Skills: `traverse` -> `bp3g`, framing -> `bp3g-frame`, no-human -> `bp3g-no-human`, landing demo -> `bp3g-landing-demo`; workflows `bp3g-node`/`bp3g-grade`/`bp3g-land` + `node-loop`; renders regenerated by `bp3 skills install --harness=all`, never hand-edited. Naming skill now teaches graph/node/state/edge/dep + bp3g. `src/quest/` -> `src/graph/`; release artifact `bp3-g`; extension spawn contract takes graph/node; completions complete g/n/e doors including the nested form.

## Frozen spellings (deliberate)

Git refs (`refs/heads/bp3/quest/`, `refs/heads/bp3/exp/`), storage paths (`docs/quests/`, `experiments/`), and every landed ledger stay byte-identical — no state rewrite; the same refs fold to identical rollups (verified: this graph's landed nodes read back unchanged). Pre-rename ledger type keys fold only in `Store.fold_type_key`, beside the mig.1 verb/state mapping — the one compat place.

## Lessons

- Word-boundary rename scripts still corrupt words that *end* in the old term (`Str.regexp`, `RegExp`, `requestAnimationFrame`, shadowing `let graph = dep_graph graph`). Grep the diff for the old term's suffixes, not just the term.
- Test fixtures hide door spellings in JS arrays (`["q", ...]`) and embedded heredocs; a text sweep for `bp3 q` misses them. Search by token, then let `make check` find the rest.
- Help text, completions, and the skills test pin each other; rename them in the same pass or the gates chase each other.

## Verification

`make check` green end to end (lint, skills 128 assertions, g/ready/diagram/blocked/pi-tree/config/link/dogfood/context/worktree/tape/hooks/bp3g/completion/release/install). Smoke: graph+node round-trip through `bp3 g`, nested `n`/`e` handoff, unclaimed `bp3 n` refuses E_NO_CONTEXT, old door refuses.
